  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Roughly chop carrot into bite-sized chunks. Slice red onion into wedges.\n• Place cauliflower, carrot and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with curry spice blend and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f853f90d0527cba53aeb56/step-fed7bf00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f853f90d0527cba53aeb56/step-df377d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop cucumber. Zest lemon to get a pinch and slice into wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber with a drizzle of olive oil and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season with salt and pepperto taste.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine the remaining garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt, lemon zest and a generous squeeze of lemon juice to garlic oil, stirring to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f853f90d0527cba53aeb56/step-eb247220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with curry-spiced cauliflower and zingy cucumber. Dollop over lemon-garlic yoghurt. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f853f90d0527cba53aeb56/step-33703330.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
